#. Description of the plugin
#: C:\wamp64\www\webtips\smoothies\wp-content\plugins\str-sticky-header\str-sticky-header.php
msgid ""
"It makes the Astra theme more efficient, more powerful and the most "
"beautiful for FREE. With SH, your Header section becomes sticky when a user "
"scrolls Up/Down on a page, and it edits the header section settings like the "
"background color, z-index...etc"
msgstr ""
"Yettara Astra d ayen igerrzen, d ayen ichevhen yerna FREE. S Astra Sticky "
"Header, aqerru (header) n l site yettuɣal yenteḍ iwsawen mi ara thsobeḍ naɣ "
"atessalid asevter (a page), yerna yettveddil isefka (options) n uḥric "
"(section) n uqerru (header) am background color, z-index...etc"

#. Author of the plugin
#: C:\wamp64\www\webtips\smoothies\wp-content\plugins\str-sticky-header\str-sticky-header.php
msgid "WebTips"
msgstr "WebTips"

#: inc/customizer.php:51
msgid "HEADER SETTINGS"
msgstr "HEADER SETTINGS"

#: inc/customizer.php:52
msgid ""
"Here, you can edit your website's header settings like the background, "
"border bottom and shadow, any editing of these parameters have to be done "
"when the Header is not sticky (in the top page)."
msgstr ""
"Dagi, tzemreḍ ad tveddeleḍ isefka (settings) n uqerru (header) n usmel-ik "
"(website) am background, border bottom, shadow. Yal aveddel n yiferdisen-a "
"(parameters), ilaq ad-yili mi ara yili Uqerru (header) n l site iwsawen "
"irkeli."

#: inc/customizer.php:53 inc/customizer.php:227 inc/customizer.php:565
#: inc/customizer.php:733 inc/customizer.php:758
msgid "h2"
msgstr ""

