#: view/admn-view.php:160 view/admn-view.php:173
msgid "Background Color"
msgstr "Background Color"

#: inc/customizer.php:67
msgid "Header Background Color. Default value : none"
msgstr "Header Background Color. Azal-is i thazwara (default value) : ulac"

#: inc/customizer.php:89 inc/customizer.php:257 inc/customizer.php:620
msgid "Background Opacity"
msgstr "Background Opacity"

#: inc/customizer.php:90
msgid ""
"Header Background Opacity. Default value : 1. You can edit it from 0 to 1 "
"only"
msgstr ""
"Header Background Opacity. Azal-is i thazwara (default value) : 1. Tzemreḍ "
"ad t-tveddeleḍ seg 0 ar 1 kan"

#: inc/customizer.php:105 inc/customizer.php:273 view/admn-view.php:185
#: view/admn-view.php:189 view/admn-view.php:194 view/admn-view.php:199
msgid "Z-index"
msgstr "Z-index"

#: inc/customizer.php:106
msgid ""
"Header Z-Index. Default value : 1. If your header is not visible, set this "
"to 1000 minimum"
msgstr ""
"Header Z-Index. Azal-is i thazwara (default value) : 1. Ma yella aqerruy "
"(header) ur yettvan ara, sars Z-index ar 1000 ma ulac ak"

#: inc/customizer.php:124 inc/customizer.php:292 inc/customizer.php:636
msgid "Border Bottom Size (px)"
msgstr "Border Bottom Size (px)"

#: inc/customizer.php:125
msgid "Header Border Bottom Size. Default value : unset."
msgstr "Header Border Bottom Size. Azal-is i thazwara (default value) : ulac."

#: inc/customizer.php:138 inc/customizer.php:306 inc/customizer.php:650
msgid "Border Bottom Color"
msgstr "Border Bottom Color"

#: inc/customizer.php:139
msgid "Header Border Bottom Color. Default value : unset."
msgstr "Header Border Bottom Color. Azal-is i thazwara (default value) : ulac."

#: inc/customizer.php:147 inc/customizer.php:659
msgid "HEADER SHADOW"
msgstr "HEADER SHADOW"

#: inc/customizer.php:148
msgid ""
"Here, you can edit your website's header shadow settings when it is not "
"sticky (in the top page)."
msgstr ""
"Dagi, tzemreḍ ad tveddeleḍ isefka (settings) n thili (shadow) n uqerru "
"(header) n usmel-ik (website) mi ara yili ur isub ara (ad yili iwsawen mara)."

#: inc/customizer.php:149 inc/customizer.php:317 inc/customizer.php:389
#: inc/customizer.php:455 inc/customizer.php:507 inc/customizer.php:590
#: inc/customizer.php:661
msgid "h3"
msgstr ""

#: inc/customizer.php:163 inc/customizer.php:331 inc/customizer.php:675
msgid "Vertical Alignment (px)"
msgstr "Vertical Alignment (px)"

#: inc/customizer.php:164
msgid ""
"Header Shadow appearance from bottom. Default value : 0. As soon as you "
"increase this value, you see it displaying."
msgstr ""
"Tamuɣli n Tili  n Uqarru si ddaw. Azal-is i thazwara : 0. Akken kan ara "
"tesnerniḍ azal-is (increase value), ad t-twaliḍ yettvan-d."

#: inc/customizer.php:178 inc/customizer.php:346 inc/customizer.php:690
msgid "Blur (px)"
msgstr "Blur (px)"

#: inc/customizer.php:179
msgid "Header Shadow Blur. Default value : 0."
msgstr "Header Shadow Blur. Azal-is i thazwara : 0."

#: inc/customizer.php:192 inc/customizer.php:360 inc/customizer.php:704
msgid "Color"
msgstr "Color"

#: inc/customizer.php:193
msgid "Header Shadow Color. Default value : black."
msgstr ""
"Lini n Tili n Uqerruy (Header Shadow Color). Azal-is i thazwara (default "
"value) : aberkan."

#: inc/customizer.php:209 inc/customizer.php:377 inc/customizer.php:721
msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "Opacity"

#: inc/customizer.php:210
msgid "Header Shadow Opacity. Default value : 0.1, recommended."
msgstr "Header Shadow Opacity. Azal-is i thazwara (default value): 0.1."

#: inc/customizer.php:225
msgid "STICKY HEADER SETTINGS"
msgstr "STICKY HEADER SETTINGS"

#: inc/customizer.php:226
msgid ""
"Here, you can make your header sticky. To be able to see the editings, you "
"should scroll your page a bit down."
msgstr ""
"Dagi, tzemreḍ ad tareḍ aqerruy (header) ineṭeḍ. Akken ad tzemreḍ ad twaliḍ "
"tiẓrigin (editings), yewid  ad subeḍ cwiṭ asevter-ik (page) dakessar."

#: inc/customizer.php:241
msgid "Sticky Header Background Color. Default value : unset."
msgstr ""
"Sticky Header Background Color. Azal-is i thazwara (default value) : ulac."

#: inc/customizer.php:258
msgid ""
"Sticky Header Background Opacity. Default value : 1. You can edit it from 0 "
"to 1 only."
msgstr ""
"Sticky Header Background Color. Azal-is i thazwara (default value) : ulac. "
"Tzemreḍ ad t-tveddeleḍ seg 0 ar 1 kan."

#: inc/customizer.php:274
msgid ""
"Sticky Header Z-Index. Default value : 1. If your header is not visible, set "
"this to 1000 minimum."
msgstr ""
"Sticky Header Z-Index. Azal-is i thazwara (default value) : 1. Ma yella "
"aqerru (header) ur yettban ara, efkas i Z-index azal n 1000 ma ulac ak."

#: inc/customizer.php:293
msgid "Sticky Header Border Bottom Size. Default value : unset."
msgstr ""
"Sticky Header Border Bottom Size. Azal-is i thazwara (default value) : ulac."

#: inc/customizer.php:307
msgid "Sticky Header Border Bottom Color. Default value : unset."
msgstr ""
"Sticky Header Border Bottom Color. Azal-is i thazwara (default value) : ulac."

#: inc/customizer.php:315
msgid "SHADOW"
msgstr "SHADOW"

#: inc/customizer.php:316
msgid ""
"In this subsection, you can edit your sticky header shadow settings. To be "
"able to see the editings, scroll down your page a bit, then start editing."
msgstr ""
"Deg umagrad-agi, tzemreḍ ad tveddeleḍ isefka-inek (settings) n tili n "
"uqerruy asma yili yenteḍ iwsawen. Akken ad tzemreḍ ad twaliḍ tiẓrigin "
"(editings), sobed cwiṭ asevter-ik (page), syen vdu tiẓrigin (editings)."

#: inc/customizer.php:332
msgid ""
"Sticky Header Shadow Appearance. Default value : 0. Once you start "
"increasing it, you will see it in your header bottom"
msgstr ""
"Sticky Header Shadow Appearance. Azal-is i thazwara (default value) : 0. Mi "
"ara tevduḍ ad t-tesnerniḍ, adivdu adittvan sedaw uqerruy (bellow header)"

#: inc/customizer.php:347
msgid "Sticky Header Shadow Blur. Default value : 0."
msgstr "Sticky Header Shadow Blur. Azal-is i thazwara (default value) : 0."

#: inc/customizer.php:361
msgid "Sticky Header Shadow Color. Default value : black."
msgstr ""
"Sticky Header Shadow Color. Azal-is i thazwara (default value) : averkan."

#: inc/customizer.php:378
msgid "Sticky Header Shadow Opacity. Default value : 0.1, recommended."
msgstr ""
"Sticky Header Shadow Opacity. Azal-is i thazwara (default value) : 0.1."

#: inc/customizer.php:387
msgid "PRIMARY MENU"
msgstr "PRIMARY MENU"

#: inc/customizer.php:388
msgid ""
"In this subsection, you can edit your website's main navigation menu when "
"your header is sticky (after scrolling a bit down)."
msgstr ""
"Deg umagrad-agi, tzemreḍ ad tveddeleḍ aḍris n usiweḍ agejdan n usmel-ik "
"(website's main navigation menu) mi ara yili uqerruy inteḍ iwsawen (asen ara "
"dtsobeḍ cwiṭ asevter (page) )."

#: inc/customizer.php:403
msgid "Sticky Header Main menu Background Color. Default value : unset."
msgstr ""
"Sticky Header Main menu Background Color. Azal-is i thazwara (default value)"

#: inc/customizer.php:416 inc/customizer.php:482 inc/customizer.php:534
msgid "Links Color - Normal"
msgstr "Links Color - Normal"

#: inc/customizer.php:417
msgid ""
"Sticky Header Main menu Links Color in a normal state. Default value : unset."
msgstr ""
"Ini (color) n Sticky Header Main menu Links asna yilin g lhala normal. Azal-"
"is i thazwara (default value): ulac."

#: inc/customizer.php:430 inc/customizer.php:496 inc/customizer.php:548
msgid "Links Color - Hover"
msgstr "Links Color - Hover"

#: inc/customizer.php:431
msgid ""
"Sticky Header Main menu Links Color in a hover state. Default value : unset."
msgstr ""
"Ini (color) n Sticky Header Main menu Links asna yilin g lhala hover. Azal-"
"is i thazwara (default value): ulac."

#: inc/customizer.php:444
msgid "Links Color - Active"
msgstr "Links Color - Active"

#: inc/customizer.php:445
msgid ""
"Sticky Header Main menu Links Color in a active state. Default value : unset."
msgstr ""
"Ini (color) n Sticky Header Main menu Links asna yilin g lhala active . Azal-"
"is i thazwara (default value): ulac."

#: inc/customizer.php:453
msgid "SUB PRIMARY MENU"
msgstr "SUB PRIMARY MENU"

#: inc/customizer.php:454
msgid ""
"In this subsection, you can edit your website's submenu of the main "
"navigation menu when your header is sticky (after scrolling a bit down)."
msgstr ""
"Deg umagrad-agi (subsection), tzemreḍ ad tveddeleḍ submenu n aḍris n main "
"navigation menu n usmel (website) mi ara yili uqerruy (header) inteḍ (asn "
"ara tsobed asevter (page) cwit dakessar)."

#: inc/customizer.php:469
msgid "Sticky Header Sub Primary Menu Background Color. Default value : unset."
msgstr ""
"Ini (color) n deffir (Background) n Sticky Header Sub Primary Menu (di "
"lahala Normal). Azal-is i thazwara (default value): ulac."

#: inc/customizer.php:483
msgid ""
"Sticky Header Sub Primary Menu Links Color (Normal State). Default value : "
"unset."
msgstr ""
"Ini (color) n Sticky Header Sub Primary Menu Links (di lahala Normal). Azal-"
"is i thazwara (default value): ulac."

#: inc/customizer.php:497
msgid ""
"Sticky Header Sub Primary Menu Links Color (Hover State). Default value : "
"unset."
msgstr ""
"Ini (color) n Sticky Header Sub Primary Menu Links (di lahala Hover). Azal-"
"is i thazwara (default value): ulac."

#: inc/customizer.php:505
msgid "SECONDARY NAVIGATION MENU"
msgstr "SECONDARY NAVIGATION MENU"

#: inc/customizer.php:506
msgid ""
"In this subsection, you can edit your website's secondary navigation menu "
"when it's sticky (after scrolling a bit down)."
msgstr ""
"Deg umagrad-agi (subsection), tzemreḍ ad tveddeleḍ secondary navigation menu "
"n usmel-ik (website) mi ara yili inteḍ (sticky), ilaq attsobed cwit asevter "
"(page) dakessar."

#: inc/customizer.php:521
msgid "Sticky Header Secondary Menu Background Color. Default value : unset."
msgstr ""
"Ini (color) n deffir (Background) n Sticky Header Secondary Menu. Azal-is i "
"thazwara (default value): ulac."

#: inc/customizer.php:535
msgid ""
"Sticky Header Secondary Menu Links Color (Normal State). Default value : "
"unset."
msgstr ""
"Ini (color) n Links n Sticky Header Secondary Menu (asn ad yili g lahal "
"Normal). Azal-is i thazwara (default value): ulac."

#: inc/customizer.php:549
msgid ""
"Sticky Header Secondary Menu Links Color (Hover State). Default value : "
"unset."
msgstr ""
"Ini (color) n Links n Sticky Header Secondary Menu (asn ad yili g lahal "
"Hover). Azal-is i thazwara (default value): ulac."

#: inc/customizer.php:563
msgid "MOBILE/TABLETTE"
msgstr "MOBILE/TABLETTE"

#: inc/customizer.php:564
msgid ""
"Here, you can make your website's header sticky in mobile screens and "
"tablettes. Don't forget to switch the display mode to Mobile view so you can "
"see the changes"
msgstr ""
"Dagi, tzemreḍ ad tareḍ aqerru (header) n usmel-ik (website) inetted (sticky) "
"deg yiḍrisen (screens) n tilifun n ufus d tfelwiyin (tablettes). Ur tettut "
"ara ad tveddeleḍ aḍris (interface) n uskan ɣer tmuɣli n tilifun iwakken ad "
"twaliḍ ibeddalen (changes)"

#: inc/customizer.php:579 view/admn-view.php:230
msgid "Sticky Header on Mobile/Tablette"
msgstr "Sticky Header on Mobile/Tablette"

#: inc/customizer.php:580
msgid ""
"When you check this, your website header will be sticky on smartphones "
"screen and tablettes. Default value : unchecked."
msgstr ""
"Mi ara tcareḍ aya, aqerru (header) n usmel-ik (website)ad yili yettwatef "
"(sticky) iwsawen deg tfelwit (interface) n tilifun ufus (smartphone). Azal-"
"is i thazwara (default value): d-ilem."

#: inc/customizer.php:588
msgid "STICKY HEADER"
msgstr "STICKY HEADER"

#: inc/customizer.php:589
msgid ""
"In this subsection, you can edit the background, border bottom and shadow of "
"the Header when it's sticky for mobile screens and tablettes only. Scroll "
"your page a bit down so you can view the changes"
msgstr ""
"Deg umagrad-agi (subsection), tzemreḍ ad tveddeleḍ ayen yellan ar deffir "
"(background), ddaw n tlisa (border Bottom) d tfelwit (shadow) n Uqerruy "
"(header) mi ara yili inteḍ iwsawen di tilifun ufus (smarphone) kan. sub cwiṭ "
"ɣer ddaw asevter-ik (page) iwakken ad twaliḍ ibeddalen (changes)"

#: inc/customizer.php:604
msgid "Mobile/Tablette Sticky Header Background Color. Default value : unset."
msgstr ""
"Ini (color) n deffir (background) n Mobile/Tablette Sticky Header. Azal-is i "
"thazwara (default value): ulac."

#: inc/customizer.php:621
msgid " Mobile/Tablette Sticky Header Background Opacity. Default value : 1."
msgstr ""
" Mobile/Tablette Sticky Header Background Opacity. Azal-is i thazwara "
"(default value): 1."

#: inc/customizer.php:637
msgid ""
" Mobile/Tablette Sticky Header Border Bottom Size. Default value : unset."
msgstr ""
" Azal (Size) n daw tlissa (Border Bottom) n Mobile/Tablette Sticky Header . "
"Azal-is i thazwara (default value): ulac."

#: inc/customizer.php:651
msgid ""
" Mobile/Tablette Sticky Header Border Bottom Color. Default value : unset."
msgstr ""
" Ini (color) n daw tlissa (Border Bottom) n Mobile/Tablette Sticky Header. "
"Azal-is i thazwara (default value): ulac."

#: inc/customizer.php:660
msgid ""
"Here, you can add a shadow to your website's sticky header, you can edit "
"settings like appearance, blur, color, and shadow opacity for mobile screens "
"and tablettes only. Scroll your page a bit down so you can view the changes."
msgstr ""
"Dagi, tzemreḍ ad ternuḍ tili (shadow) i uqerru (header) ilesqen (sticky) n "
"usmel-ik (website), tzemreḍ ad tveddeleḍ isefka am tmuɣli (appearance), "
"blur, ini (color), opacity n tili i yisekkilen (interfaces) n tilifun d "
"tfelwiyin (tablettes) kan. Sub asevter-ik (page) cwiṭ ɣer ddaw akken ad "
"twaliḍ ibeddalen (changes)."

#: inc/customizer.php:676
msgid ""
" Mobile/Tablette Sticky Header Shadow Appearance. Default value : 0. As soon "
"as you start increasing it, you will see it appearing (if you activated the "
"Mobile view interface)"
msgstr ""
" Mobile/Tablette Sticky Header Shadow Appearance. Azal-is i thazwara "
"(default value): 0. Akken kan ara tevduḍ ad t-ternuḍ, ad t-twaliḍ yettvan-d "
"(ma yella tessekcemḍ tmuɣli n tilifun - mobile interface)"

#: inc/customizer.php:691
msgid ""
" Mobile/Tablette Sticky Header Shadow Blur. Default value : 0. Do not forget "
"to switch the display mode to Mobile view so you can see the editings."
msgstr ""
" Mobile/Tablette Sticky Header Shadow Blur. Azal-is i thazwara (default "
"value): 0. Ur tettut ara ad tveddeleḍ tamuɣli ɣer tilifun (mobile interface) "
"akken ad twaliḍ iveddalen."

#: inc/customizer.php:705
msgid ""
" Mobile/Tablette Sticky Header Shadow Color. Default value : black. Do not "
"forget to switch the display mode to Mobile view so you can see the editings."
msgstr ""
" Ini (color) n Tili (shadow) n Mobile/Tablette Sticky Header. Azal-is i "
"thazwara (default value): averkan. Ur tettut ara ad tveddeleḍ tamuɣli ɣer "
"tilifun (mobile interface) akken ad twaliḍ iveddalen."

#: inc/customizer.php:722
msgid ""
"Mobile/Tablette Sticky Header Shadow Opacity. Default value : 0.1, "
"recommended. Do not forget to switch the display mode to Mobile view so you "
"can see the editings."
msgstr ""
"Opacity n Tili (Shadow) n uqarruy (header) inetden (sticky) di Mobile/"
"Tablette. Azal-is i thazwara (default value): 0.1. Ur tettut ara ad "
"tveddeleḍ askil (interface) idittvanen ɣer uskil n tilifun (smartphone view) "
"akken ad twaliḍ ivedilen."

#: inc/customizer.php:731 inc/customizer.php:747
msgid "CUSTOM CSS"
msgstr "CUSTOM CSS"

#: inc/customizer.php:732
msgid ""
"Here, you can add any CSS code that you want, in order to customize your "
"header."
msgstr ""
"Dagi, tzemreḍ ad ternuḍ yal akaram (code) CSS i tebɣiḍ, akken ad tesbeddeḍ "
"(customize) aqerruy (header) n usmel-ik (website)."

#: inc/customizer.php:748
msgid ""
"If you want to add any CSS code to customize your header, you can write it "
"inside the box bellow."
msgstr ""
"Ma tebɣiḍ ad ternuḍ kra n ukaram (code) CSS akken ad tesbeddeḍ (edit) "
"aqerruy (header), tzemreḍ ad t-taruḍ daxel n tfelwit ddaw-a."

