#: view/admn-view.php:41
msgid ""
"This plugin is an Astra theme Add-on, it improves your theme's "
"functionality, allowing the website's header to elegantly stick to the top, "
"and enhances user navigation and visual appeal effortlessly."
msgstr ""
"A S H -agi itteddu kan ɣef Astra, yettarra Astra aked usmel-inek (website) "
"ǧahden. Yessevganed aqerru (header) n usmel-inek, daɣen yetteqnit iwssawen "
