msgid "Thanks for using the %s,"
msgstr "Tanemmirt ɣef useqdec (using) n %s,"

#: view/admn-view.php:68
msgid "Header Configuration"
msgstr "Assevded n Uqerruy - Header Configuration"

#: view/admn-view.php:70
msgid "After installing and activating our plugin, the Header will become"
msgstr ""
"Mi thsoliḍ asɛeddi n SH ɣer usmel-inek (website), ad yuɣal Uqerruy n usmel"

#: view/admn-view.php:70
msgid "sticky automatically"
msgstr "ineṭed s timad-is"

#: view/admn-view.php:71
msgid ""
"If you have already set a Background Color for the Header before activating "
"this plugin, \r\n"
"        the same color will be applied after activating Stick My Header for Astra "
"for the first time."
msgstr ""
